,{"text":"Bandwidth"},{"text":"Latency"},{"text":"Reliability"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Embedded Systems & CAN"},{"type":"p","text":"The student should begin working with real microcontrollers and automotive communication concepts."},{"type":"h","text":"Embedded Systems"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Microcontrollers"},{"text":"Interrupts"},{"text":"Timers"},{"text":"PWM"},{"text":"DMA fundamentals"},{"text":"Real-time systems"},{"text":"RTOS fundamentals"},{"text":"Watchdogs"},{"text":"Memory architecture"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Automotive Communication"},{"type":"p","text":"Start with:"},{"type":"h","text":"CAN"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CAN frames"},{"text":"CAN IDs"},{"text":"Arbitration"},{"text":"Bit timing"},{"text":"Bus load"},{"text":"Error detection"},{"text":"Error frames"},{"text":"CAN controllers"},{"text":"CAN transceivers"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"p","text":"ECU 1 ──┐"},{"type":"p","text":"ECU 2 ──┤"},{"type":"p","text":"ECU 3 ──┼── CAN Bus ── Gateway"},{"type":"p","text":"ECU 4 ──┤"},{"type":"p","text":"ECU 5 ──┘"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Automotive Networks"},{"type":"p","text":"Become proficient in the major vehicle communication technologies."},{"type":"h","text":"CAN"},{"type":"p","text":"Used extensively for ECU communication."},{"type":"h","text":"LIN"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Master/slave communication"},{"text":"Low-cost networking"},{"text":"Body electronics"},{"text":"Simple sensors/actuators"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Automotive Ethernet"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Ethernet fundamentals"},{"text":"100BASE-T1 / automotive Ethernet concepts"},{"text":"Switching"},{"text":"VLAN fundamentals"},{"text":"SOME/IP"},{"text":"Service-oriented communication"}]},{"type":"h","text":"FlexRay"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand its:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Determinist